d)' per the sequence; kept as published and counted in the 120-credit total (the sequence's printed Total Credits is 120 WITH it). (3) Choice slots: WRI 1001/1002, WRI 1002/2012, BUS 1502/MTH 1502 (Business Statistics or Statistics II), [Dept] 1105 Broad Enduring Interest (any department), Culture & Society category slots, and five General Elective placeholders (2+4+1+4 = 11 cr, matching the catalog's 'General Electives (11 Credits)' row). Category mapping: catalog University Core rows -> 'core', 'CS Major/DA Minor' rows -> 'major', General Electives -> 'elective'.",
